### Data Read (2)
- `GET /j.php` — Get SpyFu data feed updates.
- `GET /NsaApi/CompetitorProjects/GetListOfMySites` — List the agent's tracked competitor sites.

### Data Write (2)
- `POST /{id}` — Submit data to a specific SpyFu resource.
- `POST /api/ingest/{ingestId}` — Submit data to SpyFu's ingestion pipeline.

### Media (1)
- `GET /embed/medias/{mediaId}` — Retrieve a specific media file.

